  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_basics.header": "Doparando el Convertidor de ogeti",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_basics.text_1": "Clicca drito pa verxare ła machina. Métare un ełemento acetà inte ła fessura de input a sinistra.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_basics.text_2": "Par indefinìa, el Convertidor de ogeti el ga bisogno de Forge Energy (FE) da un xenerador o da na bataria. El podere el pol entrar da ogni parte; ła bara de energia ła xe a sinistra del schermo.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_basics.text_3": "Rancura ła vałuta dałe do slot de output a destra. Ogni ciclo finìo el consuma un input.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_basics.text_4": "By default, the Item Sink needs Forge Energy (FE) from a generator or battery. Power can enter through any side; the energy bar is on the left of the screen.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_basics.text_5": "The machine lights up while processing. The progress arrow fills as it consumes FE. Time and FE cost depend on the item's value tier.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_basics.text_6": "Collect the currency from the two output slots on the right. Each completed cycle consumes one input item.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_basics.text_7": "Default outputs are Create: Numismatics coins. Without Numismatics, set outputItem to an installed item, such as minecraft:emerald, in item_sink-common.toml.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_automation.header": "Automating the Item Sink",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_automation.text_1": "Feed accepted items into the Item Sink with a hopper. This chest and hopper supply the input slot from above.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_automation.text_2": "A second hopper extracts currency into a chest. Automation extracts only from the two output slots, so unprocessed inputs stay inside.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_automation.text_3": "Keep FE supplied while the machine runs. Item insertion, currency extraction and FE input are available on every side.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_automation.text_4": "Processing pauses when the output slots cannot fit the next payout, or when FE runs out. Keep the output clear and the machine powered.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_automation.text_5": "Once there is room for the currency and enough FE, processing resumes automatically.",
  "jei.item_sink.any_item": "Qualsiasi ogeto",
  "jei.item_sink.currency": "Moneda",
  "jei.item_sink.overview.accepted": "Ogni ogeto co un vałor configurà el pol èsar convertìo in moneda.",
  "jei.item_sink.overview.payout": "El pagamento el dipende dal vałor de l'ogeto.",
  "jei.item_sink.overview.excluded": "De solito no se aceta monede, ogeti creativi e ogeti escludesti.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_create_automation.header": "Automating with Belts and Funnels",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_create_automation.text_1": "Funnels feed items from the belt into the sink.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_create_automation.text_2": "Supply FE to the sink and rotation to the belts.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_create_automation.text_3": "An extracting funnel sends currency onto the output belt.",
  "jei.item_sink.overview.any_item": "Any Item",
